## FSD 24.6.0

### ✨ New
- Enhanced mid-range trajectory planning for complex urban scenarios  
- Adaptive confidence weighting for multi-agent interactions  
- Predictive maneuver previews during lane changes  
- Expanded planner awareness in mixed-speed traffic environments  

### 🛠 Improvements
- Refined behavior planning logic for unprotected turns  
- Improved lateral control stability on sustained curves  
- More accurate intent prediction for surrounding vehicles  
- Reduced end-to-end latency across perception, planning, and control  
- Improved fallback behavior under fluctuating sensor confidence  

### 🐞 Fixes
- Fixed rare planner indecision during dense merge scenarios  
- Resolved intermittent UI overlay mismatches  
- Corrected delayed replans under rapid constraint changes  
- General performance and stability optimizations  

### ⚙️ Technical Notes
- Planner cost functions retuned for smoother decision transitions  
- Control loop robustness improved under variable traffic density  
- UI and control thread synchronization optimized  
- Reduced unnecessary replans in stable driving conditions  

### 📌 Summary
FSD 24.6.0 advances planning intelligence and system coordination, prioritizing smoother control behavior and improved decision-making in high-complexity driving environments.